{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DvaxqTFair7rDbQGmkykGW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  论文主线从\"confounding造成大量级系统性偏差\"转向\"联合估计是方法论上的正确做法\"。\n  真实污染量级落在0.4–0.9区间，confounding效应存在但不如mvp_003合成数据中那样剧烈。\n  G-MFRM在所有benchmark上一致优于sequential，但在某个benchmark（预计Arena-Hard）上差异不显著。\n  叙事重心：(1) formal proposition提供理论保证——即使实证增益中等，联合估计是asymptotically正确的；\n  (2) per-model c_n的可解释性价值——contamination audit作为独立贡献；\n  (3) G-MFRM在零污染时优雅退化为标准MFRM，不损失性能，因此\"没有理由不用\"。\n  Headline改为强调framework统一性和可解释性，弱化纯数字提升。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: multi_judge_data_collection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      8个judge（GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Claude Sonnet 4.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro,\n      Qwen3-235B-A22B, Qwen3.6-27B, Llama 4 Maverick, Gemini 2.5 Pro）\n      在MT-Bench (80 items)和Arena-Hard (500 items)上评估22个target models，\n      position swap后总评估数约 8×(80+500)×22×2 ≈ 203,520条。\n    expected_results:\n      num_judges: 8\n      num_target_models: 22\n      num_items_mtbench: 80\n      num_items_arenahard: 500\n      total_evaluations: 203520\n      position_bias_rate_avg: 0.12\n      inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa: 0.41\n      judge_completion_rate: 0.97\n      api_cost_usd: 820\n      gpu_hours_used: 118\n      missing_data_pct: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      8个judge中5个开源+3个API，开源judge通过vLLM批处理效率高。\n      Fleiss kappa约0.41反映LLM judge间的典型一致性水平——比random高但远非完美，\n      这正是MFRM建模judge severity的前提条件。Position bias约12%是已知现象。\n      缺失数据主要来自个别开源judge在长context item上的拒答或格式错误。\n      API成本低于$900预算因为批量调用有折扣。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A1: Judge metadata and completion statistics\"\n        columns: [judge, type, params, completion_rate, avg_score, position_bias_rate]\n        row_count: 8\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S1: Inter-judge score correlation heatmap (8×8), 显示judge pair间Spearman-ρ分布在0.55–0.82\"\n    analysis: >\n      数据规模充足，8个judge覆盖4个模型家族（OpenAI, Anthropic, Meta, Alibaba+DeepSeek）。\n      Inter-judge variance足够大（std跨judge约0.8–1.2分），为MFRM建模judge severity提供信号。\n      Position bias存在但通过swap平均后不影响后续分析。\n      数据完整度97%+，缺失模式为MCAR，不影响模型估计。\n\n  - name: constat_exposure_estimation\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      对MT-Bench 80题和Arena-Hard 500题生成rephrased reference variants，\n      计算ConStat delta scores作为exposure indicator e_i，\n      结合temporal signals（benchmark发布日期 vs 模型训练截止日期）构建composite e_i。\n    expected_results:\n      constat_rank_correlation_with_true_exposure: 0.74\n      constat_delta_score_mean: 0.15\n      constat_delta_score_std: 0.22\n      high_exposure_items_pct_mtbench: 35\n      high_exposure_items_pct_arenahard: 18\n      reference_variant_human_equivalence_p: 0.23\n      temporal_signal_correlation_with_constat: 0.48\n      composite_e_i_reliability_alpha: 0.71\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下ConStat估计质量中等（rank correlation 0.65–0.85，取中值0.74）。\n      MT-Bench作为更老的benchmark，exposure率更高（35%的item被显著记忆），\n      Arena-Hard较新且题目更长，exposure率较低（18%）。\n      ConStat delta score均值0.15表示原题与rephrased版本间的平均性能差异不大但方向一致。\n      Temporal signal与ConStat的相关性中等（0.48），说明训练数据时间线只是exposure的粗略代理。\n      Composite e_i的Cronbach α为0.71，处于\"可接受\"但非\"良好\"的心理测量学标准线上，\n      这意味着e_i估计中存在测量噪声，会传递到Stage 3的c_n估计中。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (partial): Exposure indicator statistics by benchmark\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, mean_e_i, std_e_i, pct_high_exposure, constat_reliability]\n        row_count: 2\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S2: ConStat delta score distribution (histogram), 分benchmark显示，MT-Bench右偏更明显\"\n      - \"Fig S3: Temporal signal vs ConStat delta scatter, r=0.48, 显示粗略正相关但离散度大\"\n    analysis: >\n      e_i估计质量是整个pipeline的瓶颈之一。Median档下composite reliability 0.71意味着\n      约50%的variance是信号、50%是噪声。这会导致Stage 3中c_n的shrinkage更强——\n      模型倾向于将不确定的exposure归零，从而低估真实污染。\n      Arena-Hard的低exposure率意味着该benchmark上G-MFRM与sequential的差异会更小，\n      因为contamination correction的空间本身就小。\n      Reference variant的human equivalence check通过（p=0.23 > 0.05），\n      支持ConStat方法论的有效性。\n\n  - name: gmfrm_real_data_fit\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      三阶段拟合：Stage 1 标准MFRM获得(θ,b,d)初始估计；\n      Stage 2 接入exp-002的e_i；Stage 3 联合gated模型估计所有参数含c_n。\n      NumPyro MCMC, warmup=2000, samples=4000, chains=4, NCP参数化。\n    expected_results:\n      convergence_max_rhat: 1.06\n      convergence_min_ess: 120\n      convergence_pct_params_rhat_above_1.05: 8\n      c_n_mean: 0.62\n      c_n_std: 0.35\n      c_n_range: [0.08, 1.41]\n      theta_posterior_mean_std: 0.12\n      kendall_tau_with_arena_mtbench: 0.86\n      kendall_tau_with_arena_arenahard: 0.85\n      spearman_rho_with_arena_mtbench: 0.89\n      spearman_rho_with_arena_arenahard: 0.88\n      runtime_hours: 3.2\n      num_divergent_transitions: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下真实c_n均值落在0.4–0.9区间，取0.62。22个模型的c_n从0.08（几乎无污染的新模型）\n      到1.41（高度疑似泄露的模型）分布较广，反映现实中模型间污染程度差异大。\n      收敛基本通过但不完美：92%的参数R̂<1.05，但约8%的参数（主要是个别c_n和高exposure item的交互项）\n      R̂在1.05–1.08之间，ESS最低120。这是median档的典型特征——数据信号足以支撑模型但边际参数不够锐利。\n      12个divergent transitions（占0.075%）在可接受范围内但需要报告。\n      Kendall-τ 0.86（MT-Bench）和0.85（Arena-Hard）落在median档的0.84–0.89区间内，\n      表明G-MFRM fair scores与Arena human votes的一致性良好但非卓越。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: G-MFRM convergence diagnostics\"\n        columns: [metric, value, threshold, status]\n        row_count: 6\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: Posterior c_n estimates with 90% CI for 22 models, 按c_n排序，标注known-contaminated models\"\n      - \"Fig S4: Trace plots for selected parameters (θ_top3, c_n_top3, d_j_all)\"\n    analysis: >\n      模型收敛处于\"基本通过但需要谨慎\"的状态。R̂>1.05的参数集中在高c_n模型上，\n      这些模型的contamination信号来自噪声较大的e_i，posterior不够锐利。\n      c_n均值0.62介于mvp_001（~0.5）和mvp_003（~1.5）之间但偏向低端，\n      说明真实污染存在但不如强假设那么普遍。\n      posterior c_n的排序与先验预期基本一致（已知训练数据可能包含benchmark的模型c_n更高），\n      提供face validity。\n\n  - name: baseline_comparison\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      7个baseline + G-MFRM在MT-Bench和Arena-Hard上的系统比较。\n      Metrics: Kendall-τ, Spearman-ρ with Chatbot Arena, bootstrap 95% CI。\n    expected_results:\n      mtbench_results:\n        raw_average:\n          kendall_tau: 0.78\n          spearman_rho: 0.82\n        mfrm_only:\n          kendall_tau: 0.83\n          spearman_rho: 0.86\n        sequential_bias_first:\n          kendall_tau: 0.84\n          spearman_rho: 0.87\n        sequential_contam_first:\n          kendall_tau: 0.83\n          spearman_rho: 0.86\n        cyclicjudge:\n          kendall_tau: 0.82\n          spearman_rho: 0.85\n        dcr_factor:\n          kendall_tau: 0.81\n          spearman_rho: 0.84\n        uda:\n          kendall_tau: 0.84\n          spearman_rho: 0.87\n        preference_leakage:\n          kendall_tau: 0.80\n          spearman_rho: 0.83\n        gmfrm:\n          kendall_tau: 0.86\n          spearman_rho: 0.89\n      arenahard_results:\n        raw_average:\n          kendall_tau: 0.76\n          spearman_rho: 0.80\n        mfrm_only:\n          kendall_tau: 0.82\n          spearman_rho: 0.85\n        sequential_bias_first:\n          kendall_tau: 0.83\n          spearman_rho: 0.86\n        sequential_contam_first:\n          kendall_tau: 0.82\n          spearman_rho: 0.85\n        cyclicjudge:\n          kendall_tau: 0.81\n          spearman_rho: 0.84\n        dcr_factor:\n          kendall_tau: 0.80\n          spearman_rho: 0.83\n        uda:\n          kendall_tau: 0.83\n          spearman_rho: 0.86\n        preference_leakage:\n          kendall_tau: 0.79\n          spearman_rho: 0.82\n        gmfrm:\n          kendall_tau: 0.85\n          spearman_rho: 0.88\n      delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline_mtbench: 0.02\n      delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline_arenahard: 0.02\n      wilcoxon_p_mtbench: 0.008\n      wilcoxon_p_arenahard: 0.041\n      num_benchmarks_significant_at_005: 2\n      num_benchmarks_significant_at_001: 1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下G-MFRM优于所有baseline但优势幅度收窄（delta_tau 0.01–0.04，取0.02）。\n      Best baseline在两个benchmark上分别是UDA（MT-Bench）和sequential_bias_first（Arena-Hard），\n      反映不同benchmark特性：MT-Bench的judge bias更显著（UDA擅长），Arena-Hard的contamination更突出。\n      MT-Bench上p=0.008达到显著，Arena-Hard上p=0.041勉强显著——\n      这符合median档\"在某个benchmark上差异不够显著\"的预期，Arena-Hard因exposure率低（18%）\n      导致contamination correction贡献有限。\n      CyclicJudge和DCR表现不如sequential，因为前者只处理bias、后者只处理contamination，\n      而sequential至少尝试同时处理两者（虽然有confounding）。\n      raw_average最差，验证了校正的必要性。MFRM-only优于raw但不如含contamination校正的方法。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Main results — method comparison across benchmarks\"\n        columns: [method, mtbench_tau, mtbench_tau_ci, arenahard_tau, arenahard_tau_ci, avg_tau]\n        row_count: 8\n      - name: \"Table 4: Pairwise significance tests (G-MFRM vs each baseline)\"\n        columns: [baseline, mtbench_p, arenahard_p, significant_both]\n        row_count: 7\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: Bar chart with error bars, methods × benchmarks, G-MFRM consistently highest but CI overlap with UDA/sequential on Arena-Hard\"\n      - \"Fig 4: Bootstrap distribution of Δτ(G-MFRM − best baseline), 两个benchmark分开，显示MT-Bench分布远离零、Arena-Hard分布接近零\"\n    analysis: >\n      G-MFRM在两个benchmark上均排名第一，但优势幅度在Arena-Hard上接近噪声边界。\n      这要求论文叙事不能仅依赖数字提升。策略：\n      (1) 强调联合估计的理论正确性——即使增益小，asymptotic bias direction是确定的；\n      (2) 强调c_n的可解释性——baseline都不提供per-model contamination estimates；\n      (3) 强调graceful degradation——当contamination≈0时G-MFRM不劣于MFRM-only。\n      UDA是最强竞争对手，但它是black-box且不提供contamination信息。\n\n  - name: contamination_magnitude_calibration\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      将exp-003拟合的c_n与合成MVP假设对比，确定真实污染量级。\n      分析c_n分布、与模型已知属性（训练数据时间、开源vs闭源）的关系。\n    expected_results:\n      real_c_n_mean: 0.62\n      real_c_n_median: 0.51\n      real_c_n_std: 0.35\n      pct_models_c_n_above_1: 18\n      pct_models_c_n_below_0.2: 23\n      correlation_c_n_with_training_recency: -0.43\n      correlation_c_n_with_model_size: 0.28\n      closest_mvp_scenario: \"between mvp_001 and mvp_003, closer to mvp_001\"\n      ks_test_vs_mvp001_p: 0.12\n      ks_test_vs_mvp003_p: 0.003\n    result_rationale: >\n      真实污染量级落在mvp_001和mvp_003之间但偏向mvp_001。\n      c_n均值0.62 < mvp_003的~1.5但 > mvp_001的~0.5。\n      分布右偏（mean > median），少数模型高度污染（18% c_n>1.0），多数模型轻度污染。\n      训练数据越新的模型c_n越低（r=-0.43），因为benchmark已被纳入decontamination流程。\n      模型越大c_n稍高（r=0.28），可能因为大模型记忆能力更强。\n      KS检验显示分布与mvp_001不可区分（p=0.12）但与mvp_003显著不同（p=0.003），\n      确认真实世界的contamination比mvp_003的强假设温和。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Contamination magnitude comparison — real vs synthetic\"\n        columns: [scenario, c_mean, c_std, pct_above_1, tau_gmfrm, tau_seq, delta_tau]\n        row_count: 4\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: c_n distribution overlay — real data vs mvp_001 vs mvp_003, 显示real data分布形态更接近mvp_001但右尾更厚\"\n      - \"Fig 6: c_n vs model training cutoff date scatter, 标注模型名称, r=-0.43\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文叙事的关键转折点。真实污染偏弱意味着：\n      (1) confounding效应量在实际中是中等的，不像mvp_003那样震撼——\n          但formal proposition保证了方向性，不依赖效应量大小；\n      (2) 少数高c_n模型（如疑似泄露的模型）是G-MFRM最有价值的发现——\n          per-model contamination audit的实用价值超过平均指标提升；\n      (3) 污染分布的异质性（右偏，少数高c_n）比均值本身更有信息量——\n          说明\"平均污染不严重但个别模型问题严重\"。\n      论文应将此结果框架为\"contamination是长尾分布——均值小不意味着可以忽略\"。\n\n  - name: judge_count_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      从8个judge中随机抽样2/4/6/8个judge，重复拟合G-MFRM和sequential，\n      观察性能随judge数量的变化曲线。每个配置重复20次取平均。\n    expected_results:\n      judges_2:\n        gmfrm_tau: 0.80\n        sequential_tau: 0.80\n        delta_tau: 0.00\n        convergence_pct_pass: 65\n      judges_4:\n        gmfrm_tau: 0.84\n        sequential_tau: 0.82\n        delta_tau: 0.02\n        convergence_pct_pass: 85\n      judges_6:\n        gmfrm_tau: 0.85\n        sequential_tau: 0.83\n        delta_tau: 0.02\n        convergence_pct_pass: 95\n      judges_8:\n        gmfrm_tau: 0.86\n        sequential_tau: 0.84\n        delta_tau: 0.02\n        convergence_pct_pass: 100\n      minimum_judges_for_significant_advantage: 4\n      tau_saturation_point: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      2个judge时信息不足以分离d_j和c_n·e_i——识别问题导致G-MFRM退化为接近MFRM-only，\n      与sequential无差异。收敛率仅65%因为参数过多、数据过少。\n      4个judge是G-MFRM开始显著优于sequential的临界点，但优势很小。\n      6→8个judge时性能趋于饱和，增加更多judge的边际收益递减。\n      这个结果支持\"G-MFRM需要至少4个judge\"的实用建议，\n      同时说明8个judge是足够的（无需追求更多）。\n      Median档下由于contamination信号本身中等，judge数量的要求不如强污染场景高。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Judge count sensitivity analysis\"\n        columns: [n_judges, gmfrm_tau_mean, gmfrm_tau_std, seq_tau_mean, delta, p_value, convergence_rate]\n        row_count: 4\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: Line plot — τ vs n_judges for G-MFRM and sequential, with shaded 95% CI, 显示4-judge处两线开始分离\"\n    analysis: >\n      实用价值高：为实践者提供了明确的资源-性能权衡指南。\n      4个judge是最低推荐配置，6个judge达到性能饱和。\n      这一结果也间接说明G-MFRM的contamination估计需要cross-judge信息——\n      单judge或双judge场景下c_n与d_j不可分离，是模型设计的固有限制而非缺陷。\n      论文中可用此结果回应\"评估成本太高\"的reviewer concern。\n\n  - name: exposure_indicator_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Leave-one-out消融：从composite e_i中依次去除ConStat delta、temporal signal、LogProber Safe Score，\n      观察对G-MFRM最终性能的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      full_composite:\n        tau: 0.86\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 1.00\n      without_constat:\n        tau: 0.83\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 0.61\n        tau_drop: 0.03\n      without_temporal:\n        tau: 0.85\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 0.89\n        tau_drop: 0.01\n      without_logprober:\n        tau: 0.85\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 0.91\n        tau_drop: 0.01\n      constat_only:\n        tau: 0.85\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 0.82\n      relative_importance_constat: 0.58\n      relative_importance_temporal: 0.22\n      relative_importance_logprober: 0.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      ConStat是最重要的exposure indicator（相对重要度58%），去除后τ下降0.03，\n      c_n排序与full composite的相关性骤降至0.61——说明ConStat提供了其他指标不可替代的item-level信号。\n      Temporal signal和LogProber各贡献约20%，去除任一后τ仅下降0.01。\n      但ConStat alone（不含其他信号）的τ=0.85已接近full composite的0.86，\n      说明在median档下额外指标的边际贡献有限。\n      这符合median档的ConStat估计质量中等（rank correlation 0.74）的假设——\n      ConStat提供主信号，其他指标主要在ConStat噪声大的item上起补充作用。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Exposure indicator ablation\"\n        columns: [configuration, e_i_reliability, gmfrm_tau, delta_tau, c_n_rank_corr]\n        row_count: 5\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S5: Stacked bar chart of relative importance of three indicators\"\n    analysis: >\n      ConStat的主导地位既是优势（方法论有clear anchor）也是风险（对ConStat质量敏感）。\n      论文应报告full pipeline同时讨论ConStat-only作为practical minimum。\n      Temporal signal的低贡献出人意料——可能因为training cutoff dates的粒度太粗（季度级别），\n      而contamination是item-level现象。LogProber的贡献在于区分memorization vs generalization，\n      与ConStat互补但不是必需的。\n\n  - name: facet_fit_diagnostics\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      报告所有facet的infit/outfit MNSQ，标记misfitting elements。\n      比较Stage 1 person-fit (lz, EMRi) vs Stage 3 c_n。\n    expected_results:\n      theta_infit_mean: 1.02\n      theta_outfit_mean: 1.08\n      theta_pct_misfit: 9\n      b_infit_mean: 0.99\n      b_outfit_mean: 1.05\n      b_pct_misfit: 7\n      d_infit_mean: 1.01\n      d_outfit_mean: 1.03\n      d_pct_misfit: 0\n      c_infit_mean: 1.06\n      c_outfit_mean: 1.15\n      c_pct_misfit: 18\n      lz_vs_c_n_correlation: 0.52\n      emri_vs_c_n_correlation: 0.48\n      rank1_violation_rate: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      Judge severity (d_j) fit最好——8个judge的infit/outfit都在可接受范围（0.7–1.3），\n      因为judge行为相对稳定。Item difficulty (b_i) fit良好，7%的misfit主要是多义性item。\n      Model ability (θ_n) 有9%的misfit，对应contamination效应被rank-1 c_n·e_i近似不完美捕捉的模型。\n      Contamination (c_n) 的misfit最高（18%），outfit均值1.15偏高——\n      说明rank-1假设对部分模型不够好（这些模型可能对不同item子集有不同的contamination pattern）。\n      lz与c_n的中等相关性（0.52）支持construct coherence：Stage 1检测到的person-misfit\n      确实与Stage 3估计的contamination相关，但不完全重叠（因为lz也受其他因素影响）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Facet fit statistics\"\n        columns: [facet, n, infit_mean, infit_sd, outfit_mean, outfit_sd, pct_misfit]\n        row_count: 4\n      - name: \"Table S1: Misfitting elements detail\"\n        columns: [element, facet, infit, outfit, flag, interpretation]\n        row_count: 12\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S6: Wright map showing θ, b, d distributions on common logit scale\"\n      - \"Fig S7: lz vs c_n scatter plot, r=0.52, 标注misfit models\"\n    analysis: >\n      c_n的18% misfit率和rank-1 violation rate 14%是需要在limitations中讨论的。\n      这不invalidate结果但限制了对individual c_n estimates的over-interpretation。\n      建议论文：(1) 报告misfit统计作为transparency；(2) 将c_n解释为\"contamination tendency\"\n      而非精确量化；(3) 指出rank-k扩展作为future work。\n      lz-c_n相关性0.52是适中的——足以支持construct validity但不足以claim equivalence。\n\n  - name: confounding_formal_proposition\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      推导sequential estimator在d_j与c_n·e_i非正交条件下的一阶bias近似，\n      通过Monte Carlo在realistic参数范围上验证bias direction和magnitude。\n    expected_results:\n      bias_direction_correct_pct: 97\n      first_order_approx_correlation_with_true_bias: 0.91\n      bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.1: 0.018\n      bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.2: 0.041\n      bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.3: 0.072\n      monte_carlo_n_conditions: 540\n      monte_carlo_reps_per_condition: 200\n      proposition_applies_pct_realistic_range: 89\n    result_rationale: >\n      Formal proposition在97%的Monte Carlo条件下正确预测bias方向——\n      这是该proposition的核心价值：即使magnitude不大，direction是确定的。\n      一阶近似与真实bias的相关性0.91说明近似质量高。\n      Median档的confounding ρ在0.1–0.3，对应bias magnitude 0.018–0.072，\n      这解释了为什么实证增益中等（bias存在但不大）。\n      89%的realistic parameter range满足proposition条件（正则性条件在极端参数下可能违反）。\n      这个结果的论文价值在于：即使exp-004的empirical Δτ只有0.02，\n      proposition证明了sequential estimator在理论上是biased的，方向可预测。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: First-order bias approximation validation\"\n        columns: [rho_dj_ce, bias_median, bias_95ci, direction_correct_pct, approx_correlation]\n        row_count: 5\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1b: Bias direction and magnitude as function of ρ(d_j, c_n·e_i), with shaded realistic range\"\n      - \"Fig S8: Monte Carlo bias distributions at ρ=0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 显示bias非对称分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是median档下最重要的补充论证。当empirical gains中等时，\n      formal proposition提供\"方法论上正确\"的保证，独立于效应量大小。\n      论文Section 2应以toy example + proposition开头，在reader看到实验结果前\n      就建立\"联合估计是唯一asymptotically无偏的做法\"的认知框架。\n      89%的coverage在realistic range上足够——11%的failure cases对应极低contamination（c<0.1），\n      此时bias本身negligible，不影响结论。\n\n  - name: wildbench_replication\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      在WildBench上复制G-MFRM全流程，作为第三个benchmark的cross-benchmark generalization。\n      使用exp-001相同的8个judge。\n    expected_results:\n      num_items_wildbench: 1024\n      gmfrm_tau: 0.84\n      sequential_tau: 0.83\n      delta_tau: 0.01\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.062\n      c_n_correlation_with_mtbench: 0.71\n      c_n_correlation_with_arenahard: 0.68\n      convergence_max_rhat: 1.07\n      convergence_min_ess: 95\n      exposure_rate_wildbench: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      WildBench是最新的benchmark（exposure率最低，仅12%），contamination correction空间最小。\n      G-MFRM优势仅Δτ=0.01，p=0.062未达0.05显著水平——\n      这是median档预期的\"在某个benchmark上差异不显著\"的具体实现。\n      跨benchmark的c_n相关性中高（0.68–0.71），说明contamination是model-level属性\n      （而非benchmark-specific），支持construct validity。\n      收敛比MT-Bench/Arena-Hard稍差（R̂ 1.07, ESS 95），\n      因为WildBench items更长更复杂，judge评分方差更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 (extended): WildBench results appended to main comparison\"\n        columns: [method, wildbench_tau, wildbench_tau_ci]\n        row_count: 8\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S9: Cross-benchmark c_n consistency scatter (WildBench vs MT-Bench), r=0.71\"\n    analysis: >\n      WildBench结果p>0.05是median档的关键现实：在低contamination benchmark上G-MFRM的empirical advantage消失。\n      论文处理策略：(1) 报告为\"G-MFRM在低contamination场景下不劣于sequential\"（graceful degradation）；\n      (2) 强调c_n的cross-benchmark一致性（0.68–0.71）作为contamination estimates的validity evidence；\n      (3) 将WildBench定位为\"G-MFRM优雅退化的实证验证\"而非\"第三个胜利\"。\n      Cross-benchmark c_n一致性是额外贡献：证明c_n捕捉的是真实的model-level属性。\n\n  - name: adversarial_robustness\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      按Wang et al. (ICLR 2026)的方法构造adversarial contamination，\n      测试G-MFRM在对抗性条件下的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      adversarial_c_n_detection_rate: 0.68\n      adversarial_tau_gmfrm: 0.82\n      adversarial_tau_sequential: 0.78\n      adversarial_delta_tau: 0.04\n      adversarial_false_positive_rate: 0.12\n      adversarial_rmse_degradation_vs_clean: 15\n      adversarial_types_tested: 3\n      paraphrase_attack_detection_rate: 0.45\n      direct_memorization_detection_rate: 0.88\n      partial_memorization_detection_rate: 0.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      Adversarial条件下G-MFRM的优势反而更明显（Δτ=0.04 vs clean的0.02），\n      因为adversarial contamination加大了confounding效应，放大了sequential的bias。\n      但detection rate仅68%——paraphrase attack（item被改写后memorize）最难检测（45%），\n      因为ConStat的reference variant方法本身基于paraphrasing，与攻击机制重叠。\n      Direct memorization检测率高（88%），因为信号明确。\n      False positive rate 12%在可接受范围但不低——意味着约12%的\"干净\"模型被错误标记为高c_n。\n      RMSE在adversarial条件下相比clean场景退化15%，说明adversarial contamination\n      部分绕过了e_i estimation，限制了G-MFRM的校正能力。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S2: Adversarial robustness results by attack type\"\n        columns: [attack_type, detection_rate, gmfrm_tau, seq_tau, delta_tau, fpr]\n        row_count: 3\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S10: ROC curves for contamination detection under three adversarial conditions\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adversarial结果揭示了G-MFRM的边界条件：paraphrase attack是核心弱点，\n      因为它破坏了ConStat的基本假设（原题与变体的性能差异反映memorization）。\n      论文应在limitations中讨论此局限，并指出这不是G-MFRM特有的——\n      任何依赖exposure indicator的方法都有同样的问题。\n      Positive takeaway: 即使在adversarial条件下，G-MFRM仍优于sequential（Δτ=0.04），\n      说明joint estimation的结构性优势在更恶劣条件下反而更突出。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11171,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11171},"output_tokens":28,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2d0e975-07c9-40f2-b411-d1e2cb564302","uuid":"cb1bcf9a-9339-4e6b-8d90-7a8d878ea058"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":202103,"duration_api_ms":203146,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  论文主线从\"confounding造成大量级系统性偏差\"转向\"联合估计是方法论上的正确做法\"。\n  真实污染量级落在0.4–0.9区间，confounding效应存在但不如mvp_003合成数据中那样剧烈。\n  G-MFRM在所有benchmark上一致优于sequential，但在某个benchmark（预计Arena-Hard）上差异不显著。\n  叙事重心：(1) formal proposition提供理论保证——即使实证增益中等，联合估计是asymptotically正确的；\n  (2) per-model c_n的可解释性价值——contamination audit作为独立贡献；\n  (3) G-MFRM在零污染时优雅退化为标准MFRM，不损失性能，因此\"没有理由不用\"。\n  Headline改为强调framework统一性和可解释性，弱化纯数字提升。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: multi_judge_data_collection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      8个judge（GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Claude Sonnet 4.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro,\n      Qwen3-235B-A22B, Qwen3.6-27B, Llama 4 Maverick, Gemini 2.5 Pro）\n      在MT-Bench (80 items)和Arena-Hard (500 items)上评估22个target models，\n      position swap后总评估数约 8×(80+500)×22×2 ≈ 203,520条。\n    expected_results:\n      num_judges: 8\n      num_target_models: 22\n      num_items_mtbench: 80\n      num_items_arenahard: 500\n      total_evaluations: 203520\n      position_bias_rate_avg: 0.12\n      inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa: 0.41\n      judge_completion_rate: 0.97\n      api_cost_usd: 820\n      gpu_hours_used: 118\n      missing_data_pct: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      8个judge中5个开源+3个API，开源judge通过vLLM批处理效率高。\n      Fleiss kappa约0.41反映LLM judge间的典型一致性水平——比random高但远非完美，\n      这正是MFRM建模judge severity的前提条件。Position bias约12%是已知现象。\n      缺失数据主要来自个别开源judge在长context item上的拒答或格式错误。\n      API成本低于$900预算因为批量调用有折扣。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A1: Judge metadata and completion statistics\"\n        columns: [judge, type, params, completion_rate, avg_score, position_bias_rate]\n        row_count: 8\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S1: Inter-judge score correlation heatmap (8×8), 显示judge pair间Spearman-ρ分布在0.55–0.82\"\n    analysis: >\n      数据规模充足，8个judge覆盖4个模型家族（OpenAI, Anthropic, Meta, Alibaba+DeepSeek）。\n      Inter-judge variance足够大（std跨judge约0.8–1.2分），为MFRM建模judge severity提供信号。\n      Position bias存在但通过swap平均后不影响后续分析。\n      数据完整度97%+，缺失模式为MCAR，不影响模型估计。\n\n  - name: constat_exposure_estimation\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      对MT-Bench 80题和Arena-Hard 500题生成rephrased reference variants，\n      计算ConStat delta scores作为exposure indicator e_i，\n      结合temporal signals（benchmark发布日期 vs 模型训练截止日期）构建composite e_i。\n    expected_results:\n      constat_rank_correlation_with_true_exposure: 0.74\n      constat_delta_score_mean: 0.15\n      constat_delta_score_std: 0.22\n      high_exposure_items_pct_mtbench: 35\n      high_exposure_items_pct_arenahard: 18\n      reference_variant_human_equivalence_p: 0.23\n      temporal_signal_correlation_with_constat: 0.48\n      composite_e_i_reliability_alpha: 0.71\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下ConStat估计质量中等（rank correlation 0.65–0.85，取中值0.74）。\n      MT-Bench作为更老的benchmark，exposure率更高（35%的item被显著记忆），\n      Arena-Hard较新且题目更长，exposure率较低（18%）。\n      ConStat delta score均值0.15表示原题与rephrased版本间的平均性能差异不大但方向一致。\n      Temporal signal与ConStat的相关性中等（0.48），说明训练数据时间线只是exposure的粗略代理。\n      Composite e_i的Cronbach α为0.71，处于\"可接受\"但非\"良好\"的心理测量学标准线上，\n      这意味着e_i估计中存在测量噪声，会传递到Stage 3的c_n估计中。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (partial): Exposure indicator statistics by benchmark\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, mean_e_i, std_e_i, pct_high_exposure, constat_reliability]\n        row_count: 2\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S2: ConStat delta score distribution (histogram), 分benchmark显示，MT-Bench右偏更明显\"\n      - \"Fig S3: Temporal signal vs ConStat delta scatter, r=0.48, 显示粗略正相关但离散度大\"\n    analysis: >\n      e_i估计质量是整个pipeline的瓶颈之一。Median档下composite reliability 0.71意味着\n      约50%的variance是信号、50%是噪声。这会导致Stage 3中c_n的shrinkage更强——\n      模型倾向于将不确定的exposure归零，从而低估真实污染。\n      Arena-Hard的低exposure率意味着该benchmark上G-MFRM与sequential的差异会更小，\n      因为contamination correction的空间本身就小。\n      Reference variant的human equivalence check通过（p=0.23 > 0.05），\n      支持ConStat方法论的有效性。\n\n  - name: gmfrm_real_data_fit\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      三阶段拟合：Stage 1 标准MFRM获得(θ,b,d)初始估计；\n      Stage 2 接入exp-002的e_i；Stage 3 联合gated模型估计所有参数含c_n。\n      NumPyro MCMC, warmup=2000, samples=4000, chains=4, NCP参数化。\n    expected_results:\n      convergence_max_rhat: 1.06\n      convergence_min_ess: 120\n      convergence_pct_params_rhat_above_1.05: 8\n      c_n_mean: 0.62\n      c_n_std: 0.35\n      c_n_range: [0.08, 1.41]\n      theta_posterior_mean_std: 0.12\n      kendall_tau_with_arena_mtbench: 0.86\n      kendall_tau_with_arena_arenahard: 0.85\n      spearman_rho_with_arena_mtbench: 0.89\n      spearman_rho_with_arena_arenahard: 0.88\n      runtime_hours: 3.2\n      num_divergent_transitions: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下真实c_n均值落在0.4–0.9区间，取0.62。22个模型的c_n从0.08（几乎无污染的新模型）\n      到1.41（高度疑似泄露的模型）分布较广，反映现实中模型间污染程度差异大。\n      收敛基本通过但不完美：92%的参数R̂<1.05，但约8%的参数（主要是个别c_n和高exposure item的交互项）\n      R̂在1.05–1.08之间，ESS最低120。这是median档的典型特征——数据信号足以支撑模型但边际参数不够锐利。\n      12个divergent transitions（占0.075%）在可接受范围内但需要报告。\n      Kendall-τ 0.86（MT-Bench）和0.85（Arena-Hard）落在median档的0.84–0.89区间内，\n      表明G-MFRM fair scores与Arena human votes的一致性良好但非卓越。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: G-MFRM convergence diagnostics\"\n        columns: [metric, value, threshold, status]\n        row_count: 6\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: Posterior c_n estimates with 90% CI for 22 models, 按c_n排序，标注known-contaminated models\"\n      - \"Fig S4: Trace plots for selected parameters (θ_top3, c_n_top3, d_j_all)\"\n    analysis: >\n      模型收敛处于\"基本通过但需要谨慎\"的状态。R̂>1.05的参数集中在高c_n模型上，\n      这些模型的contamination信号来自噪声较大的e_i，posterior不够锐利。\n      c_n均值0.62介于mvp_001（~0.5）和mvp_003（~1.5）之间但偏向低端，\n      说明真实污染存在但不如强假设那么普遍。\n      posterior c_n的排序与先验预期基本一致（已知训练数据可能包含benchmark的模型c_n更高），\n      提供face validity。\n\n  - name: baseline_comparison\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      7个baseline + G-MFRM在MT-Bench和Arena-Hard上的系统比较。\n      Metrics: Kendall-τ, Spearman-ρ with Chatbot Arena, bootstrap 95% CI。\n    expected_results:\n      mtbench_results:\n        raw_average:\n          kendall_tau: 0.78\n          spearman_rho: 0.82\n        mfrm_only:\n          kendall_tau: 0.83\n          spearman_rho: 0.86\n        sequential_bias_first:\n          kendall_tau: 0.84\n          spearman_rho: 0.87\n        sequential_contam_first:\n          kendall_tau: 0.83\n          spearman_rho: 0.86\n        cyclicjudge:\n          kendall_tau: 0.82\n          spearman_rho: 0.85\n        dcr_factor:\n          kendall_tau: 0.81\n          spearman_rho: 0.84\n        uda:\n          kendall_tau: 0.84\n          spearman_rho: 0.87\n        preference_leakage:\n          kendall_tau: 0.80\n          spearman_rho: 0.83\n        gmfrm:\n          kendall_tau: 0.86\n          spearman_rho: 0.89\n      arenahard_results:\n        raw_average:\n          kendall_tau: 0.76\n          spearman_rho: 0.80\n        mfrm_only:\n          kendall_tau: 0.82\n          spearman_rho: 0.85\n        sequential_bias_first:\n          kendall_tau: 0.83\n          spearman_rho: 0.86\n        sequential_contam_first:\n          kendall_tau: 0.82\n          spearman_rho: 0.85\n        cyclicjudge:\n          kendall_tau: 0.81\n          spearman_rho: 0.84\n        dcr_factor:\n          kendall_tau: 0.80\n          spearman_rho: 0.83\n        uda:\n          kendall_tau: 0.83\n          spearman_rho: 0.86\n        preference_leakage:\n          kendall_tau: 0.79\n          spearman_rho: 0.82\n        gmfrm:\n          kendall_tau: 0.85\n          spearman_rho: 0.88\n      delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline_mtbench: 0.02\n      delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline_arenahard: 0.02\n      wilcoxon_p_mtbench: 0.008\n      wilcoxon_p_arenahard: 0.041\n      num_benchmarks_significant_at_005: 2\n      num_benchmarks_significant_at_001: 1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下G-MFRM优于所有baseline但优势幅度收窄（delta_tau 0.01–0.04，取0.02）。\n      Best baseline在两个benchmark上分别是UDA（MT-Bench）和sequential_bias_first（Arena-Hard），\n      反映不同benchmark特性：MT-Bench的judge bias更显著（UDA擅长），Arena-Hard的contamination更突出。\n      MT-Bench上p=0.008达到显著，Arena-Hard上p=0.041勉强显著——\n      这符合median档\"在某个benchmark上差异不够显著\"的预期，Arena-Hard因exposure率低（18%）\n      导致contamination correction贡献有限。\n      CyclicJudge和DCR表现不如sequential，因为前者只处理bias、后者只处理contamination，\n      而sequential至少尝试同时处理两者（虽然有confounding）。\n      raw_average最差，验证了校正的必要性。MFRM-only优于raw但不如含contamination校正的方法。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Main results — method comparison across benchmarks\"\n        columns: [method, mtbench_tau, mtbench_tau_ci, arenahard_tau, arenahard_tau_ci, avg_tau]\n        row_count: 8\n      - name: \"Table 4: Pairwise significance tests (G-MFRM vs each baseline)\"\n        columns: [baseline, mtbench_p, arenahard_p, significant_both]\n        row_count: 7\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: Bar chart with error bars, methods × benchmarks, G-MFRM consistently highest but CI overlap with UDA/sequential on Arena-Hard\"\n      - \"Fig 4: Bootstrap distribution of Δτ(G-MFRM − best baseline), 两个benchmark分开，显示MT-Bench分布远离零、Arena-Hard分布接近零\"\n    analysis: >\n      G-MFRM在两个benchmark上均排名第一，但优势幅度在Arena-Hard上接近噪声边界。\n      这要求论文叙事不能仅依赖数字提升。策略：\n      (1) 强调联合估计的理论正确性——即使增益小，asymptotic bias direction是确定的；\n      (2) 强调c_n的可解释性——baseline都不提供per-model contamination estimates；\n      (3) 强调graceful degradation——当contamination≈0时G-MFRM不劣于MFRM-only。\n      UDA是最强竞争对手，但它是black-box且不提供contamination信息。\n\n  - name: contamination_magnitude_calibration\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      将exp-003拟合的c_n与合成MVP假设对比，确定真实污染量级。\n      分析c_n分布、与模型已知属性（训练数据时间、开源vs闭源）的关系。\n    expected_results:\n      real_c_n_mean: 0.62\n      real_c_n_median: 0.51\n      real_c_n_std: 0.35\n      pct_models_c_n_above_1: 18\n      pct_models_c_n_below_0.2: 23\n      correlation_c_n_with_training_recency: -0.43\n      correlation_c_n_with_model_size: 0.28\n      closest_mvp_scenario: \"between mvp_001 and mvp_003, closer to mvp_001\"\n      ks_test_vs_mvp001_p: 0.12\n      ks_test_vs_mvp003_p: 0.003\n    result_rationale: >\n      真实污染量级落在mvp_001和mvp_003之间但偏向mvp_001。\n      c_n均值0.62 < mvp_003的~1.5但 > mvp_001的~0.5。\n      分布右偏（mean > median），少数模型高度污染（18% c_n>1.0），多数模型轻度污染。\n      训练数据越新的模型c_n越低（r=-0.43），因为benchmark已被纳入decontamination流程。\n      模型越大c_n稍高（r=0.28），可能因为大模型记忆能力更强。\n      KS检验显示分布与mvp_001不可区分（p=0.12）但与mvp_003显著不同（p=0.003），\n      确认真实世界的contamination比mvp_003的强假设温和。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Contamination magnitude comparison — real vs synthetic\"\n        columns: [scenario, c_mean, c_std, pct_above_1, tau_gmfrm, tau_seq, delta_tau]\n        row_count: 4\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: c_n distribution overlay — real data vs mvp_001 vs mvp_003, 显示real data分布形态更接近mvp_001但右尾更厚\"\n      - \"Fig 6: c_n vs model training cutoff date scatter, 标注模型名称, r=-0.43\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文叙事的关键转折点。真实污染偏弱意味着：\n      (1) confounding效应量在实际中是中等的，不像mvp_003那样震撼——\n          但formal proposition保证了方向性，不依赖效应量大小；\n      (2) 少数高c_n模型（如疑似泄露的模型）是G-MFRM最有价值的发现——\n          per-model contamination audit的实用价值超过平均指标提升；\n      (3) 污染分布的异质性（右偏，少数高c_n）比均值本身更有信息量——\n          说明\"平均污染不严重但个别模型问题严重\"。\n      论文应将此结果框架为\"contamination是长尾分布——均值小不意味着可以忽略\"。\n\n  - name: judge_count_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      从8个judge中随机抽样2/4/6/8个judge，重复拟合G-MFRM和sequential，\n      观察性能随judge数量的变化曲线。每个配置重复20次取平均。\n    expected_results:\n      judges_2:\n        gmfrm_tau: 0.80\n        sequential_tau: 0.80\n        delta_tau: 0.00\n        convergence_pct_pass: 65\n      judges_4:\n        gmfrm_tau: 0.84\n        sequential_tau: 0.82\n        delta_tau: 0.02\n        convergence_pct_pass: 85\n      judges_6:\n        gmfrm_tau: 0.85\n        sequential_tau: 0.83\n        delta_tau: 0.02\n        convergence_pct_pass: 95\n      judges_8:\n        gmfrm_tau: 0.86\n        sequential_tau: 0.84\n        delta_tau: 0.02\n        convergence_pct_pass: 100\n      minimum_judges_for_significant_advantage: 4\n      tau_saturation_point: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      2个judge时信息不足以分离d_j和c_n·e_i——识别问题导致G-MFRM退化为接近MFRM-only，\n      与sequential无差异。收敛率仅65%因为参数过多、数据过少。\n      4个judge是G-MFRM开始显著优于sequential的临界点，但优势很小。\n      6→8个judge时性能趋于饱和，增加更多judge的边际收益递减。\n      这个结果支持\"G-MFRM需要至少4个judge\"的实用建议，\n      同时说明8个judge是足够的（无需追求更多）。\n      Median档下由于contamination信号本身中等，judge数量的要求不如强污染场景高。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Judge count sensitivity analysis\"\n        columns: [n_judges, gmfrm_tau_mean, gmfrm_tau_std, seq_tau_mean, delta, p_value, convergence_rate]\n        row_count: 4\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: Line plot — τ vs n_judges for G-MFRM and sequential, with shaded 95% CI, 显示4-judge处两线开始分离\"\n    analysis: >\n      实用价值高：为实践者提供了明确的资源-性能权衡指南。\n      4个judge是最低推荐配置，6个judge达到性能饱和。\n      这一结果也间接说明G-MFRM的contamination估计需要cross-judge信息——\n      单judge或双judge场景下c_n与d_j不可分离，是模型设计的固有限制而非缺陷。\n      论文中可用此结果回应\"评估成本太高\"的reviewer concern。\n\n  - name: exposure_indicator_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Leave-one-out消融：从composite e_i中依次去除ConStat delta、temporal signal、LogProber Safe Score，\n      观察对G-MFRM最终性能的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      full_composite:\n        tau: 0.86\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 1.00\n      without_constat:\n        tau: 0.83\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 0.61\n        tau_drop: 0.03\n      without_temporal:\n        tau: 0.85\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 0.89\n        tau_drop: 0.01\n      without_logprober:\n        tau: 0.85\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 0.91\n        tau_drop: 0.01\n      constat_only:\n        tau: 0.85\n        c_n_rank_correlation_with_full: 0.82\n      relative_importance_constat: 0.58\n      relative_importance_temporal: 0.22\n      relative_importance_logprober: 0.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      ConStat是最重要的exposure indicator（相对重要度58%），去除后τ下降0.03，\n      c_n排序与full composite的相关性骤降至0.61——说明ConStat提供了其他指标不可替代的item-level信号。\n      Temporal signal和LogProber各贡献约20%，去除任一后τ仅下降0.01。\n      但ConStat alone（不含其他信号）的τ=0.85已接近full composite的0.86，\n      说明在median档下额外指标的边际贡献有限。\n      这符合median档的ConStat估计质量中等（rank correlation 0.74）的假设——\n      ConStat提供主信号，其他指标主要在ConStat噪声大的item上起补充作用。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Exposure indicator ablation\"\n        columns: [configuration, e_i_reliability, gmfrm_tau, delta_tau, c_n_rank_corr]\n        row_count: 5\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S5: Stacked bar chart of relative importance of three indicators\"\n    analysis: >\n      ConStat的主导地位既是优势（方法论有clear anchor）也是风险（对ConStat质量敏感）。\n      论文应报告full pipeline同时讨论ConStat-only作为practical minimum。\n      Temporal signal的低贡献出人意料——可能因为training cutoff dates的粒度太粗（季度级别），\n      而contamination是item-level现象。LogProber的贡献在于区分memorization vs generalization，\n      与ConStat互补但不是必需的。\n\n  - name: facet_fit_diagnostics\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      报告所有facet的infit/outfit MNSQ，标记misfitting elements。\n      比较Stage 1 person-fit (lz, EMRi) vs Stage 3 c_n。\n    expected_results:\n      theta_infit_mean: 1.02\n      theta_outfit_mean: 1.08\n      theta_pct_misfit: 9\n      b_infit_mean: 0.99\n      b_outfit_mean: 1.05\n      b_pct_misfit: 7\n      d_infit_mean: 1.01\n      d_outfit_mean: 1.03\n      d_pct_misfit: 0\n      c_infit_mean: 1.06\n      c_outfit_mean: 1.15\n      c_pct_misfit: 18\n      lz_vs_c_n_correlation: 0.52\n      emri_vs_c_n_correlation: 0.48\n      rank1_violation_rate: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      Judge severity (d_j) fit最好——8个judge的infit/outfit都在可接受范围（0.7–1.3），\n      因为judge行为相对稳定。Item difficulty (b_i) fit良好，7%的misfit主要是多义性item。\n      Model ability (θ_n) 有9%的misfit，对应contamination效应被rank-1 c_n·e_i近似不完美捕捉的模型。\n      Contamination (c_n) 的misfit最高（18%），outfit均值1.15偏高——\n      说明rank-1假设对部分模型不够好（这些模型可能对不同item子集有不同的contamination pattern）。\n      lz与c_n的中等相关性（0.52）支持construct coherence：Stage 1检测到的person-misfit\n      确实与Stage 3估计的contamination相关，但不完全重叠（因为lz也受其他因素影响）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Facet fit statistics\"\n        columns: [facet, n, infit_mean, infit_sd, outfit_mean, outfit_sd, pct_misfit]\n        row_count: 4\n      - name: \"Table S1: Misfitting elements detail\"\n        columns: [element, facet, infit, outfit, flag, interpretation]\n        row_count: 12\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S6: Wright map showing θ, b, d distributions on common logit scale\"\n      - \"Fig S7: lz vs c_n scatter plot, r=0.52, 标注misfit models\"\n    analysis: >\n      c_n的18% misfit率和rank-1 violation rate 14%是需要在limitations中讨论的。\n      这不invalidate结果但限制了对individual c_n estimates的over-interpretation。\n      建议论文：(1) 报告misfit统计作为transparency；(2) 将c_n解释为\"contamination tendency\"\n      而非精确量化；(3) 指出rank-k扩展作为future work。\n      lz-c_n相关性0.52是适中的——足以支持construct validity但不足以claim equivalence。\n\n  - name: confounding_formal_proposition\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      推导sequential estimator在d_j与c_n·e_i非正交条件下的一阶bias近似，\n      通过Monte Carlo在realistic参数范围上验证bias direction和magnitude。\n    expected_results:\n      bias_direction_correct_pct: 97\n      first_order_approx_correlation_with_true_bias: 0.91\n      bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.1: 0.018\n      bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.2: 0.041\n      bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.3: 0.072\n      monte_carlo_n_conditions: 540\n      monte_carlo_reps_per_condition: 200\n      proposition_applies_pct_realistic_range: 89\n    result_rationale: >\n      Formal proposition在97%的Monte Carlo条件下正确预测bias方向——\n      这是该proposition的核心价值：即使magnitude不大，direction是确定的。\n      一阶近似与真实bias的相关性0.91说明近似质量高。\n      Median档的confounding ρ在0.1–0.3，对应bias magnitude 0.018–0.072，\n      这解释了为什么实证增益中等（bias存在但不大）。\n      89%的realistic parameter range满足proposition条件（正则性条件在极端参数下可能违反）。\n      这个结果的论文价值在于：即使exp-004的empirical Δτ只有0.02，\n      proposition证明了sequential estimator在理论上是biased的，方向可预测。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: First-order bias approximation validation\"\n        columns: [rho_dj_ce, bias_median, bias_95ci, direction_correct_pct, approx_correlation]\n        row_count: 5\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1b: Bias direction and magnitude as function of ρ(d_j, c_n·e_i), with shaded realistic range\"\n      - \"Fig S8: Monte Carlo bias distributions at ρ=0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 显示bias非对称分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是median档下最重要的补充论证。当empirical gains中等时，\n      formal proposition提供\"方法论上正确\"的保证，独立于效应量大小。\n      论文Section 2应以toy example + proposition开头，在reader看到实验结果前\n      就建立\"联合估计是唯一asymptotically无偏的做法\"的认知框架。\n      89%的coverage在realistic range上足够——11%的failure cases对应极低contamination（c<0.1），\n      此时bias本身negligible，不影响结论。\n\n  - name: wildbench_replication\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      在WildBench上复制G-MFRM全流程，作为第三个benchmark的cross-benchmark generalization。\n      使用exp-001相同的8个judge。\n    expected_results:\n      num_items_wildbench: 1024\n      gmfrm_tau: 0.84\n      sequential_tau: 0.83\n      delta_tau: 0.01\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.062\n      c_n_correlation_with_mtbench: 0.71\n      c_n_correlation_with_arenahard: 0.68\n      convergence_max_rhat: 1.07\n      convergence_min_ess: 95\n      exposure_rate_wildbench: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      WildBench是最新的benchmark（exposure率最低，仅12%），contamination correction空间最小。\n      G-MFRM优势仅Δτ=0.01，p=0.062未达0.05显著水平——\n      这是median档预期的\"在某个benchmark上差异不显著\"的具体实现。\n      跨benchmark的c_n相关性中高（0.68–0.71），说明contamination是model-level属性\n      （而非benchmark-specific），支持construct validity。\n      收敛比MT-Bench/Arena-Hard稍差（R̂ 1.07, ESS 95），\n      因为WildBench items更长更复杂，judge评分方差更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 (extended): WildBench results appended to main comparison\"\n        columns: [method, wildbench_tau, wildbench_tau_ci]\n        row_count: 8\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S9: Cross-benchmark c_n consistency scatter (WildBench vs MT-Bench), r=0.71\"\n    analysis: >\n      WildBench结果p>0.05是median档的关键现实：在低contamination benchmark上G-MFRM的empirical advantage消失。\n      论文处理策略：(1) 报告为\"G-MFRM在低contamination场景下不劣于sequential\"（graceful degradation）；\n      (2) 强调c_n的cross-benchmark一致性（0.68–0.71）作为contamination estimates的validity evidence；\n      (3) 将WildBench定位为\"G-MFRM优雅退化的实证验证\"而非\"第三个胜利\"。\n      Cross-benchmark c_n一致性是额外贡献：证明c_n捕捉的是真实的model-level属性。\n\n  - name: adversarial_robustness\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      按Wang et al. (ICLR 2026)的方法构造adversarial contamination，\n      测试G-MFRM在对抗性条件下的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      adversarial_c_n_detection_rate: 0.68\n      adversarial_tau_gmfrm: 0.82\n      adversarial_tau_sequential: 0.78\n      adversarial_delta_tau: 0.04\n      adversarial_false_positive_rate: 0.12\n      adversarial_rmse_degradation_vs_clean: 15\n      adversarial_types_tested: 3\n      paraphrase_attack_detection_rate: 0.45\n      direct_memorization_detection_rate: 0.88\n      partial_memorization_detection_rate: 0.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      Adversarial条件下G-MFRM的优势反而更明显（Δτ=0.04 vs clean的0.02），\n      因为adversarial contamination加大了confounding效应，放大了sequential的bias。\n      但detection rate仅68%——paraphrase attack（item被改写后memorize）最难检测（45%），\n      因为ConStat的reference variant方法本身基于paraphrasing，与攻击机制重叠。\n      Direct memorization检测率高（88%），因为信号明确。\n      False positive rate 12%在可接受范围但不低——意味着约12%的\"干净\"模型被错误标记为高c_n。\n      RMSE在adversarial条件下相比clean场景退化15%，说明adversarial contamination\n      部分绕过了e_i estimation，限制了G-MFRM的校正能力。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S2: Adversarial robustness results by attack type\"\n        columns: [attack_type, detection_rate, gmfrm_tau, seq_tau, delta_tau, fpr]\n        row_count: 3\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S10: ROC curves for contamination detection under three adversarial conditions\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adversarial结果揭示了G-MFRM的边界条件：paraphrase attack是核心弱点，\n      因为它破坏了ConStat的基本假设（原题与变体的性能差异反映memorization）。\n      论文应在limitations中讨论此局限，并指出这不是G-MFRM特有的——\n      任何依赖exposure indicator的方法都有同样的问题。\n      Positive takeaway: 即使在adversarial条件下，G-MFRM仍优于sequential（Δτ=0.04），\n      说明joint estimation的结构性优势在更恶劣条件下反而更突出。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d2d0e975-07c9-40f2-b411-d1e2cb564302","total_cost_usd":0.34293524999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11171,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"output_tokens":10461,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11171,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10461,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11171,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11171},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5748,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0058579999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":10461,"cacheReadInputTokens":11447,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11171,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.33707725,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"e1a1b17d-3bcc-466a-a08c-4877435345eb"}
